    "updated_at": "2018-01-09T19:16:04Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure if the edge case applies to fetch in general -- as the issue happens when making a new xhr in the onabort handler. (I'm not an expert on fetch though)\r\nIn general - it likely makes sense to have an upper bound on how late fetches can be queued.\r\n\r\n",
